    "Six recorded workload runs are measured examples, not hardware-normalized comparisons or WAN performance guarantees.",
    "The selected DuckDB/Quack fork sources include the canonical changes. Fresh binary acceptance is reported separately by GitHub Actions and release package manifests; historical result files remain unchanged."
  ],
